WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 6.6 · MEAL: Monitoring, Evaluation, Accountability & Learning
The MEAL plan and budget

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Your MEAL plan is a short manual for your evidence, even if there are only one or two of you.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Name who collects, checks, analyses and reports.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Write down the time MEAL takes you.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Include MEAL in your first proposals and budget.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You write the roles, calendar and budget for your first year.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
